# STIG AS24-U1-000270: The Apache web server must provide install options to exclud
# STIG ID: V-214242 (HIGH)

META
    esp_id `apache-as24-u1-000270-default-content-removed-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `apache`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG AS24-U1-000270: The Apache web server must provide install options to exclude the installation o`
    description `The Apache web server must provide install options to exclude the installation of documentation, sample code, example applications, and tutorials.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `apache,stig,disa-stig,config`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:AS24-U1-000270,NIST-800-53:CM-7`
    control_objective `CM-7`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Apache:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Apache STIG guidance for AS24-U1-000270.`

    component_id `comp-apache-web`

    impl_CM_7 `This control is validated by checking the Apache HTTP server configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR config_path string `/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`

    OBJECT httpd_config
        path VAR config_path
    OBJECT_END

    STATE config_check
        content string contains `index.html`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_content
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF config_check
            OBJECT_REF httpd_config
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
